/Title (Lyra is a metal apparatus \(generally made from solid or tube steel\). We have lyras in a wide variety of sizes to fit campers of all heights, shapes, and abilities. Students learn how to invert, spin, pose, and transition as they build core and upper body strength. This is a great apparatus for those who love to spin! Campers can take the next step and try the Sphere.)
